Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Stamen Speaks (Through the Micro-Lens)
- Story & Context: In the sterile chambers of Sector 7, archivist Elara discovered a pre-Forgetting audio-log in an ancient data crystal, detailing a lone botanist's dying wish to hear her last seed germinate, but the recording skipped erratically. Elara patched it, and a voice, impossibly clear, uttered, "The earth remembers, even when the air forgets." This glitch became the sample that birthed the Chrono-Rhizome, a sonic seed of hope and despair.
- Visual & Lyrics Prompt: A microscopic view of a glowing pollen grain under a stylized electron microscope, slowly splitting open to reveal intricate circuitry and ancient, pixelated script. The background is a vast, blurred expanse of stars.

