- Story & Context: Legend has it that when the First Sprout of the Phylac-Krypta finally pierced the protective casing and unfurled, it drained every watt of auxiliary power, plunging the entire vault into a silent, breathless darkness for a single, terrifying hour, testing the faith of all present. Keeper Jian recounted later that the silence was deeper than any ocean, "A hush fell, and the chlorophyll levied its terrible, beautiful tax." That hour became a sacred space for the genre’s deepest sonic reflections.
